@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Hiragino Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ranksep 24
skinparam nodesep 22
skinparam ArrowColor #526476
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #66778B
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #EFF3F7
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam packageBorderColor #8D9AA8
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor #EFF3F7
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF9E8
skinparam dpi 170
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
actor "利用者 / UI" as user
participant "Command\nOperation" as op
participant "Order\nAggregate" as agg
participant "UoW /\nDataStore" as store
participant "Domain\nEvent" as event
participant "Query\nOperation" as query
participant "View /\nDisplay" as view
group 更新系 [CQRS]
user -[#197A58]> op : 注文確定の要求
op -[#197A58]> agg : 状態・規則・金額の確認
agg --[#197A58]> op : 更新候補
op -[#197A58]> store : 条件付き確定
store --[#197A58]> op : 確定結果
op --[#197A58]> user : 更新の結果
end
op -[#9064A5]> event : 確定した事実
event -[#9064A5]> view : 選択した経路で投影
group 参照系 [CQRS]
user -[#2768A6]> query : 注文の照会
query -[#2768A6]> view : 認可・必要な鮮度
view --[#2768A6]> query : 状態・金額を持つ参照結果
query --[#2768A6]> user : 表示結果
end
note over agg, view
金額などのValue Objectは両系統に現れる。
更新確定と投影・配信完了は別の状態。
end note
@enduml
